WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Phunziroli likuyang'ana m'mphepete mwa disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona.

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:47.477
Chitsanzochi chikusonyeza m'mphepete movuta kuona.

00:00:54.953 --> 00:01:14.953
Chitsanzo chomaliza chikuyerekezera m'mphepete mooneka bwino ndi mossaoneka bwino.
